5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to see us all gathered. Let us find a way to share these costs that keeps our hearts warm and our spirits light.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree. I want us to be fair, but more importantly, I want us to make sure we are all still getting along well.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder if some people are paying more than others... I want to know if everyone is happy with the current way.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's make this quick and painless, shall we? I just want to make sure we aren't throwing money into a void.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I just... I hope we can find a way that isn't too... difficult to manage.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, do not worry. Simplicity is often the highest form of sophistication. We shall find a path that suits everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, that is a good point. Maybe we should look at how things have been handled so far to see if there are any tensions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, I think so. I want to see if the rumors about people ""carrying"" others are true. I don't like it when people are upset.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Minato, always so worried about the mood! I'm more interested in the actual numbers. I want to see the real damage.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just don't want anyone to have to spend too much time... you know... doing the math every month.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,Life is too short for resentment over a few coins. Let us look at the facts and the feelings together.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think looking at the payment history might be helpful. It shows us not just the money, but how we've interacted.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I agree with Midori. I want to see the logs. And maybe how other houses do it? I want to learn.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm with you on the logs, but I want to know if changing the system costs us anything upfront. I'm not paying for a fancy upgrade.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Maybe... a template? If we have a template, maybe it won't take as long to figure out who owes what.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,A wise approach. I shall look into the habits of others and the physical needs of our rooms to ensure no one freezes in silence.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will look into the payment logs and the statements. I want to see where the friction has been.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I'll look at the payment log too, and the monthly settle from another house. I want to see if it's peaceful there.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'll take the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote. I need to see the yearly cycle and the cost of change.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll look at the trial run of a reconciliation template and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
