35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I have learned that when the cost is fixed, the mind is free. We must ensure our system does not make us prisoners of our own frugality.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,I noticed that some payments were quite late. It seems like the confusion over the amounts might be causing some stress between us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I saw that too... it makes me sad that people were arguing about the amounts. But the other house's way seemed very... long and tiring.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Well, the statements are a nightmare. The bills swing wildly every month. It's like a gamble, and I'm tired of losing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I saw the template. It looks like it takes a really long time to fill out. And the logs... it seems like it's always a struggle.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the swings of the seasons are like the swings of life. But we can build a bridge over those valleys to keep us steady.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I agree that a complex template might just add more stress. We need something that is clear and doesn't feel like an accusation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't want us to spend forty minutes arguing every month. That doesn't sound peaceful at all.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"A bridge is fine, Servas, but bridges cost money. I checked the quote for sub-meters, and it's way too expensive to just ""be fair.""","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,If it's too complex... the person doing it... they might just... give up. Or get really stressed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Then we must choose a path of grace. If we cannot measure every watt, we must trust each other to be mindful without being afraid.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Exactly. I think we should prioritize a system that reduces the need for constant reminders, as those seem to be the source of the tension.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I just want to make sure no one feels like they are paying for someone else's luxury. That's what makes people grumpy, right?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"Exactly, Minato. I'm not paying for someone's space heater while I'm shivering. But I'm also not paying 34,000 yen for a meter.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think... maybe a simple split is better? Even if it's not perfect... if it's fast... it might be better for everyone.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Simplicity is a gift we give to one another. Let us consider options that balance the burden without weighing down our spirits.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's look for a solution that is transparent but doesn't require a spreadsheet that looks like a tax audit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can find a way where everyone feels it's fair. I don't like the idea of ""carrying"" someone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"As long as I'm not paying a ""second rent"" in February, I'm open to suggestions. Let's see what the options are.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just hope it's not... too much work for one person.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
