60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option B offers a sanctuary of predictability. It allows us to live without the fear of a switch, knowing the cost is already settled.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I like Option B too. It removes the monthly ""shock"" and the need for constant reminders, which should help us get along better.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A sounds the most fair, but May said it's too expensive. Option B seems... calm. No one has to worry every month.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is out—too expensive. Option C is what we've been doing, and it's a disaster in winter. Option B is the only one that makes sense.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B... means you only have to do the big calculation once a year... instead of every month. That... sounds much better.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. When we remove the immediate cost of a small comfort, we allow kindness to return to the home.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"It also prevents that feeling of ""who used more this month?"" which I think has been hurting our friendships.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I think I like that. If we all agree on a price, then no one is ""carrying"" anyone else in the moment. It feels more equal.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,It's the only way I can actually budget my life. I can't have my bank account bleeding out just because it's January.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It's... it's much less work for the person... managing it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,It seems we have found a harmony. A shared agreement that protects both the pocket and the peace of mind.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we're all on the same page. I think this will really help us stop feeling like we're accusing each other.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm happy everyone is agreeing. It's much nicer when we all just smile and say it's okay.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"For once, we're actually being efficient. I'm in for Option B. Let's just make sure the ""end of year"" settle isn't a total shock.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm okay with that. It's... it's a lot easier.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us cast our votes with a spirit of generosity. May our home be a place of warmth, both in temperature and in heart.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm ready. I believe this is the best way to heal the tension and keep things fair.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,Me too! I'll vote for the one that keeps us all friends.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,Let's just get this over with. Option B it is.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for B too.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
